essage","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"で、おそらく `$` を使わずに選択した場合に末尾空白を削除するのが上の `zy` ではないかと。","ts":"1622424655.207800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dA/la"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18417c24-c3b6-4d46-b12a-5542386ef16c","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`$` で行末まで選択した場合のみ影響するのかな？","ts":"1622424545.206400","thread_ts":"1622424545.206400","reply_count":3,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PAak"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99772f56-7bb9-4c5a-a851-7ab59d3ed37a","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"普通に `P` で貼り付けると、\n```/path/subdir        ;text\n/path/longsubdir    ;text\n/path/longlongsubdir;text```","ts":"1622424447.205800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G12n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b6dcf99-55ca-4e70-b849-b2843b1962b1","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"テストを見ると、\n```/path;text\n/path;text\n/path;text```\nというテキストを用意して、次に\n```/subdir\n/longsubdir\n/longlongsubdir```\nを `\u0026lt;C-v\u0026gt;2j$` でyankして、元のテキストの `;` の位置に `zP` で貼り付けると、\n```/path/subdir;text\n/path/longsubdir;text\n/path/longlongsubdir;text```\nになってます。","ts":"1622424414.205300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6aSA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11e33308-ed92-41f8-a202-c6dd60d571c8","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```Included patches: 1-2914```","ts":"1622423491.202400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Zun"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60b4430b-24c9-41ff-8d5c-e32ce5f4f472","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"今ビルドしたやつですね","ts":"1622423466.202100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WWl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd8d7080-ca04-411b-9241-aa896ef2b54c","t